<section
  class="immersive-section ownership-journey"
  id="capital-boundary"
  data-ownership-journey
  data-boundary-scene-state="boundary"
  aria-labelledby="capital-boundary-title"
>
  <div class="immersive-shell">
    <header class="container ownership-journey__head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">The center of Jethos</span><h2 id="capital-boundary-title">
          One home where you stay in control.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">
        Jethos cannot move, invest or use assets held in your wallet unless you authorize it. If you
        choose to invest, you decide how much, when and where. You also choose how much complexity
        you want to manage, so you can always understand where your money goes.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="immersive-viewport" data-webgl-host>
      <div class="immersive-fallback" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="fallback-object fallback--ownership"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      </div><span class="immersive-status" data-webgl-status>Loading visual</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ownership-stage-wrap">
      <div class="ownership-stage">
        <article class="ownership-side ownership-side--wallet" data-ownership-side="wallet">
          <span class="ownership-side__index">01 · Your account</span>
          <h3>You have control. You have custody.</h3>
          <p>
            Your wallet is yours. Its 24-word recovery phrase is created for you when you sign up
            and is never stored by Jethos.
          </p>
          <p>
            Your money stays in your wallet until you approve an action. You choose what moves, how
            much and where it goes.
          </p>
          <div
            class="ownership-app-window ownership-wallet-preview"
            data-wallet-allocation
            aria-label="Illustrative wallet interface"
          >
            <div class="ownership-window-bar"><span>Wallet</span><small>Liquid assets</small></div>
            <div class="wallet-preview__total">
              <small>Total balance</small><strong>$9,200.00</strong><span
                >Available in your wallet</span
              >
            </div>
            <div class="wallet-preview__body">
              <div class="wallet-preview__assets">
                <button type="button" data-wallet-asset="usdc" aria-pressed="false"
                  ><i class="asset-dot asset-dot--usdc"></i><span
                    ><strong>USDC</strong><small>3,900 USDC</small></span
                  ><span class="wallet-asset-value"><b>$3,900</b><small>42% of wallet</small></span
                  ></button
                >
                <button type="button" data-wallet-asset="usdt" aria-pressed="false"
                  ><i class="asset-dot asset-dot--usdt"></i><span
                    ><strong>USDT</strong><small>1,800 USDT</small></span
                  ><span class="wallet-asset-value"><b>$1,800</b><small>20% of wallet</small></span
                  ></button
                >
                <button type="button" data-wallet-asset="btc" aria-pressed="false"
                  ><i class="asset-dot asset-dot--btc"></i><span
                    ><strong>BTC</strong><small>0.031 BTC</small></span
                  ><span class="wallet-asset-value"><b>$2,100</b><small>23% of wallet</small></span
                  ></button
                >
                <button type="button" data-wallet-asset="eth" aria-pressed="false"
                  ><i class="asset-dot asset-dot--eth"></i><span
                    ><strong>ETH</strong><small>0.48 ETH</small></span
                  ><span class="wallet-asset-value"><b>$1,400</b><small>15% of wallet</small></span
                  ></button
                >
              </div>
              <svg
                class="wallet-preview__chart"
                viewBox="0 0 100 100"
                role="group"
                aria-label="Illustrative asset allocation. Use each asset row or chart segment to inspect its share."
              >
                <circle class="wallet-preview__track" cx="50" cy="50" r="34" pathLength="100"
                ></circle>
                <g transform="rotate(-90 50 50)">
                  <circle
                    class="wallet-preview__slice wallet-preview__slice--usdc"
                    data-wallet-slice="usdc"
                    cx="50"
                    cy="50"
                    r="34"
                    pathLength="100"
                    stroke-dasharray="40 60"
                    stroke-dashoffset="0"
                    tabindex="0"
                    role="button"
                    aria-label="USDC: 42 percent, 3,900 dollars"></circle>
                  <circle
                    class="wallet-preview__slice wallet-preview__slice--usdt"
                    data-wallet-slice="usdt"
                    cx="50"
                    cy="50"
                    r="34"
                    pathLength="100"
                    stroke-dasharray="18 82"
                    stroke-dashoffset="-42"
                    tabindex="0"
                    role="button"
                    aria-label="USDT: 20 percent, 1,800 dollars"></circle>
                  <circle
                    class="wallet-preview__slice wallet-preview__slice--btc"
                    data-wallet-slice="btc"
                    cx="50"
                    cy="50"
                    r="34"
                    pathLength="100"
                    stroke-dasharray="21 79"
                    stroke-dashoffset="-62"
                    tabindex="0"
                    role="button"
                    aria-label="BTC: 23 percent, 2,100 dollars"></circle>
                  <circle
                    class="wallet-preview__slice wallet-preview__slice--eth"
                    data-wallet-slice="eth"
                    cx="50"
                    cy="50"
                    r="34"
                    pathLength="100"
                    stroke-dasharray="13 87"
                    stroke-dashoffset="-85"
                    tabindex="0"
                    role="button"
                    aria-label="ETH: 15 percent, 1,400 dollars"></circle>
                </g>
                <text
                  x="50"
                  y="48"
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  class="wallet-preview__chart-value"
                  data-wallet-chart-value>$9.2k</text
                >
                <text
                  x="50"
                  y="59"
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  class="wallet-preview__chart-label"
                  data-wallet-chart-label>liquid</text
                >
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="ownership-bridge ownership-bridge--out" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
          </div>
          <div class="ownership-warning">
            <strong>Keep your recovery phrase private.</strong><span
              >It is the key to recovering your wallet. Never share it with anyone.</span
            >
          </div>
        </article>

        <article
          class="finance-panel ownership-ledger ownership-ledger--center"
          data-ownership-dashboard
          aria-label="The Jethos account and vault boundary"
        >
          <div class="cluster cluster--between">
            <span class="eyebrow">Your financial home</span><span class="badge badge--illustrative"
              >Illustrative</span
            >
          </div>
          <p class="muted panel-kicker">Assets visible through Jethos</p><div class="balance-total">
            $12,480.00
          </div>
          <div class="balance-split">
            <div class="balance-card balance-card--wallet">
              <span class="badge badge--live">Available</span><span class="metric__label"
                >In your wallet</span
              ><div class="metric__value">$9,200</div><small class="muted"
                >Under your direct control</small
              >
            </div>
            <div class="balance-card balance-card--vault">
              <span class="badge badge--illustrative">Invested</span><span class="metric__label"
                >In transparent vaults</span
              ><div class="metric__value">$3,280</div><small class="muted"
                >Route, rules and risk visible</small
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="finance-panel__boundary">
            <span>Exact authorization</span><i class="boundary-node" aria-hidden="true"></i><span
              >Transparent vault</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="route-strip">
            <span>Hold</span><i class="route-line" aria-hidden="true"></i><span
              >Invest · understand · exit</span
            >
          </div>
          <p class="source-label panel-source">Example interface—not live account data</p>
        </article>

        <article class="ownership-side ownership-side--vaults" data-ownership-side="vaults">
          <span class="ownership-side__index">02 · Your vault experience</span>
          <h3>You choose how, when and where to invest.</h3>
          <p class="ownership-mode-intro">
            Pick the experience that feels right. Base keeps it simple. Pro adds network choice.
            Advanced also lets you choose the asset.
          </p>
          <div class="ownership-app-window ownership-vault-preview">
            <aside class="ownership-vault-popover" data-vault-popover hidden aria-live="polite">
              <div class="ownership-vault-popover__head">
                <div>
                  <span class="eyebrow">Illustrative allocation</span><strong
                    data-vault-popover-title>Conservative vault</strong
                  >
                </div><button
                  type="button"
                  data-vault-popover-close
                  aria-label="Close allocation details">×</button
                >
              </div>
              <p data-vault-popover-summary>
                Where this illustrative vault would place its capital.
              </p>
              <div class="ownership-allocation-layout">
                <div class="ownership-allocation-list" data-vault-popover-allocations></div>
                <svg
                  class="ownership-allocation-chart"
                  viewBox="0 0 120 120"
                  role="img"
                  aria-label="Illustrative vault allocation. Hover a segment or list item to inspect it."
                >
                  <circle
                    class="ownership-allocation-chart__track"
                    cx="60"
                    cy="60"
                    r="42"
                    pathLength="100"></circle>
                  <g transform="rotate(-90 60 60)" data-vault-popover-slices></g>
                  <text x="60" y="57" text-anchor="middle" data-vault-chart-value>100%</text>
                  <text x="60" y="70" text-anchor="middle" data-vault-chart-label>allocated</text>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <small>Example only. This is not a live allocation or an available product.</small>
            </aside>
            <div class="ownership-window-bar">
              <span>Vaults</span><small>Choose your view</small>
            </div>
            <div class="ownership-mode-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Vault experience level">
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="true"
                aria-controls="vault-mode-panel"
                data-vault-mode="base">Base</button
              >
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="false"
                aria-controls="vault-mode-panel"
                data-vault-mode="pro">Pro</button
              >
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                aria-selected="false"
                aria-controls="vault-mode-panel"
                data-vault-mode="advanced">Advanced</button
              >
            </div>
            <div class="ownership-mode-panel" id="vault-mode-panel" role="tabpanel">
              <div class="ownership-mode-copy">
                <span class="badge badge--illustrative">Example</span><p data-vault-mode-copy>
                  Choose how much to invest and the level of risk that feels right. Jethos keeps
                  network and asset details out of the way.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="ownership-filters" data-chain-filter hidden>
                <span>Network</span>
                <div class="ownership-chip-row" role="group" aria-label="Illustrative network">
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-chain="plasma">Plasma</button>
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-chain="ethereum">Ethereum</button>
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-chain="arbitrum">Arbitrum</button>
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-chain="base">Base</button>
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-chain="bnb">BNB Chain</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ownership-filters" data-token-filter hidden>
                <span>Authorized asset</span>
                <div class="ownership-chip-row" role="group" aria-label="Illustrative asset">
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-token="usdc">USDC</button>
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-token="usdt">USDT</button>
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-token="btc">BTC</button>
                  <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-token="eth">ETH</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ownership-vault-list" aria-live="polite">
                <button type="button" data-vault-option="conservative"
                  ><div>
                    <span class="vault-risk vault-risk--low">Lower risk</span><strong
                      data-vault-name>Conservative</strong
                    ><small data-vault-detail>More liquidity, fewer moving parts</small>
                  </div><span
                    ><small>Illustrative APY</small><strong data-vault-apy>3.2%</strong></span
                  ></button
                >
                <button type="button" data-vault-option="balanced"
                  ><div>
                    <span class="vault-risk vault-risk--medium">Moderate risk</span><strong
                      data-vault-name>Balanced</strong
                    ><small data-vault-detail>A balance between growth and flexibility</small>
                  </div><span
                    ><small>Illustrative APY</small><strong data-vault-apy>5.1%</strong></span
                  ></button
                >
                <button type="button" data-vault-option="opportunity"
                  ><div>
                    <span class="vault-risk vault-risk--high">Higher risk</span><strong
                      data-vault-name>Opportunity</strong
                    ><small data-vault-detail>More ways to earn, with more risk</small>
                  </div><span
                    ><small>Illustrative APY</small><strong data-vault-apy>7.8%</strong></span
                  ></button
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="ownership-bridge ownership-bridge--in" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container ownership-boundary-explainer">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">The capital boundary · six checks</p><h3>
          Nothing crosses it silently.
        </h3><p>
          Six distinct checks follow capital from wallet ownership to withdrawal: who controls it,
          what is requested, what gets signed, how the position is represented, where it is
          allocated and under which conditions it can return.
        </p>
      </header>
      <div class="boundary-steps">
        <article class="boundary-step--wallet">
          <span>01</span><strong>Wallet ownership</strong><small
            >Your recovery phrase secures the wallet. Jethos neither stores it nor can recreate it.</small
          >
        </article>
        <article class="boundary-step--authorization">
          <span>02</span><strong>Explicit intent</strong><small
            >You choose the asset, exact amount, requested action and destination before continuing.</small
          >
        </article>
        <article class="boundary-step--authorization">
          <span>03</span><strong>Wallet authorization</strong><small
            >The wallet shows what will be signed. Nothing moves without a valid confirmation.</small
          >
        </article>
        <article class="boundary-step--vault">
          <span>04</span><strong>Vault position</strong><small
            >Only the deposited amount enters vault rules; shares represent the resulting economic
            position.</small
          >
        </article>
        <article class="boundary-step--vault">
          <span>05</span><strong>Visible allocation</strong><small
            >Eligible integrations, current routes, costs and material dependencies should remain
            inspectable.</small
          >
        </article>
        <article class="boundary-step--vault">
          <span>06</span><strong>Withdrawal</strong><small
            >You request the exit; timing and amount remain subject to contract state, reserves and
            available liquidity.</small
          >
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="immersive-controls boundary-path-controls">
        <div class="immersive-legend" aria-label="Step color legend">
          <span class="immersive-key immersive-key--wallet">Wallet control</span><span
            class="immersive-key immersive-key--gate">Intent &amp; authorization</span
          ><span class="immersive-key immersive-key--vault">Vault position &amp; exit</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
